.Sh HISTORY
The default digest was changed from MD5 to SHA256 in OpenSSL 1.1.0.
.Pp
The
.Sy -list
option was added in OpenSSL 1.1.1e.
.Pp
The
.Sy -ciphers
and
.Sy -engine
options were deprecated in OpenSSL 3.0.
.Pp
The
.Sy -saltlen
option was added in OpenSSL 3.2.
.Pp
The
.Sy -skeymgmt
and
.Sy -skeyopt
options were added in OpenSSL 3.5.
